# Changed Left to RESTORE Key (Page_Up)
PageUp       48
RightBracket 49
SingleQuote  50
Right        51
BackQuote    52
BackSlash    53
Dash         54
Slash        55
1            56
Home         57
Tab          58
2            59
Space        60
Control_L    61
q            62
Escape       63
